          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "రాజ్యం (rājyaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit rājya, \"kingship\", and later \"a kingdom\" (CDIAL 10694), built on rājan, \"a king\"."
            }
          ]
        },
